%     datamunge.discriminant  The discriminant of p: `(-1)^(n(n-1)/2) * resultant(p, p') / lc(p)`, where n = degree(p). Zero if and only if p has a repeated root.
%     datamunge.leapfrog_gaussian_acceptance  Exact expected Metropolis acceptance of one HMC proposal (fixed step size and number of leapfrog steps, unit mass) on a one-dimensional
%     datamunge.gaussian_importance_efficiency  Asymptotic effective-sample-size fraction
%     datamunge.rgb_to_gray  The standard luma-weighted RGB -> grayscale conversion (ITU-R BT.601 coefficients, the same weights Pillow's "L" conversion and most other libraries use).
%     datamunge.rgb_to_hsv  C++ datamunge::image::rgb_to_hsv.
%     datamunge.hsv_to_rgb  C++ datamunge::image::hsv_to_rgb.
